SUMMARY:Market Activities with Ms. Lisa and Ms. Cheryl
DESCRIPTION:All children are invited to join us at our library table from 
 5-6pm during the Bloomfield Community Farmers Market!  We will feature 
 special themed crafts\, games\, and other fun activities while the market 
 is active.\n\nThe Farmers Market is on Tuesdays from 3:30-6:30pm and runs 
 from June 2 - October 27.
