SUMMARY:Repair Cafe hosted by Bloomfield's Recycling Committee and Environmental Commission
DESCRIPTION:Broken toaster? Busted bike? Ripped sweater? Don't toss it--fix 
 it for free! Volunteer experts will help you repair your items while you 
 wait-- tools and materials provided! \n\nHelp reduce waste\, save money and 
 give your stuff a new life. Limit of 2 items per person.\n\nQuestions or 
 want to volunteer? Email brianaseferian@gmail.com
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Quiet Study\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
