DTSTART:20260801T180000Z
DTEND:20260801T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
SUMMARY:One Fine Tapestry: A Carole King Tribute
DESCRIPTION:Gerard and Diane Barros are a unique husband and wife / 
 keyboard and guitar duo\, specializing in 2-part harmonies. They will 
 instantly sweep you back in time with audience favorites throughout the 
 decades. They use an "old school duo" approach to playing instruments and 
 singing live\, with no prerecorded or computerized tracks. Diane's vocals 
 and percussion are accompanied by Gerard's harmonies\, while he plays 
 right-handed keyboard\, left-handed bass and works the drum machine with 
 his foot. A portion of the show even consists of Gerard playing acoustic 
 guitar along with Diane's hand percussion\, as they harmonize to many of 
 the great hits of the past.
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Theater\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Performance
UID:LibCal-10270-17040083
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17040083
END:VEVENT
