SUMMARY:Summer Reading Grand Finale!
DESCRIPTION:Meet us in the library courtyard for a final celebration of our 
 summer reading achievements!  Special guests from the Bloomfield Fire 
 Department and Bloomfield Kiwanis will help us show our appreciation for 
 our youngest summer readers. There will be games\, music\, dancing\, 
 snacks\, ice cream\, and sprinklers - bring your own towel!\n\nIn case of 
 inclement weather\, this event will be relocated to the first floor of the 
 Main Library.  All children and their grownups are welcome!
