SUMMARY:PET ADOPTION EVENT: Find Your Furry Friend with Rosemarie's Rescue Ranch
DESCRIPTION:Stop by the library on August 8th from 11am to 2pm to meet your 
 new fur bestie! All animals present will be from foster homes through 
