DTEND:20260828T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260828T000000Z
SUMMARY:Vitalant Blood Drive
DESCRIPTION:Don’t Let the Heat Keep You from Saving a Life – Give Blood 
 in August.  \nGive blood Aug. 1-31 to help patients this summer — and 
 we’ll thank you with a $15 Rewards gift card.* Must use code 
 AUGUST15-2026-V when \nscheduling your appointment. Schedule your 
 appointment today!\n\nDonor Rewards program opt-in required for gift card. 
 \n\n\nMake an appointment at vitalant.org\nUse zip code: 07003 or call 
 877-25-VITAL\n\n\nBLOOMFIELD LIBRARY BLOOD DRIVE ON THE BLOODMOBILE\n90 
 Broad Street\nBloomfield\, NJ 07003\nFriday\, August 28\, 2026\n11:00 a.m. 
 to 2:15 p.m.\nAppointments are strongly recommended.  Please bring valid 
 photo identification.  Do not forget to eat and drink plenty of water!
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Theater\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
UID:LibCal-10270-17199696
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17199696
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260830T160000Z
DTEND:20260830T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260830T000000Z
SUMMARY:Mayor's Back-to-School Bookbag Giveaway
DESCRIPTION:Bloomfield Public Library will be attending the Mayor's 
 Back-to-School Bookbag Giveaway! This event will be at Felton Field (145 
 Floyd Ave\, Bloomfield NJ).\n\nRegister Now for the Mayor’s 
 Back-to-School Bookbag Giveaway! \nBloomfield families are invited to sign 
 up for this annual community event hosted by Mayor Jenny Mundell and the 
 Township Council. Eligible Bloomfield students entering Pre-K through 8th 
 grade can receive a free bookbag and enjoy an afternoon of family-friendly 
 activities as they prepare for the upcoming school year.\nSpace is limited 
 and registration is required.\nReserve your spot today: 
 tinyurl.com/BookbagGiveaway26\nQuestions? Contact Bloomfield Human Services 
 at (973) 680-4017.
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Theater\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
