 the Wax in the Stacks Record Club. We will meet at 6:30 pm in the Main 
 Library to discuss and appreciate some excellent music. Drop-In & enjoy the 
 tunes!\n\nRegister if you want to bring a record to share with the club. 
 \n\nTo register contact Alex - alex.russo@bloomfield.bccls.org or 
 973-566-6200 ext 215
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Quiet Study\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-10270-17329048
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/calendar/bloomfield/Wax
END:VEVENT
