SUMMARY:Get to Know Your Library!
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Oakes Pond on September 16th at 6:45pm to learn 
 about what the Bloomfield Public Library has to offer! There is something 
 for everyone here at the library. We will discuss materials\, resources and 
 programs that are FREE to the residents of Bloomfield.\n\n \n\nThis program 
 will be held at Oakes Pond Club House (440 Memorial Pkwy\, Bloomfield\, NJ 
 07003). All are welcome!
